  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "歹路m̄-thang行 ——韓國總統ê àu戲拖棚kap部份同胞ê引喻失當"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span><b style=\"font-size: x-large;\">黃睿里</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī 2024年12月初3 ê 21:22（台灣時間），大韓民國大統領（本文suà--來叫做總統）尹錫悅以電視直播ê方式發表講演，指控反對黨占多數ê國會串通北韓，刁持以彈劾（tân-hi̍k）內閣成員、阻擋預算通過等等ê手路khia空南韓ê自由民主，隨後宣佈戒嚴，指揮軍隊beh阻擋國會議員入去國會表決撤回戒嚴，首都Soo-ū（華語做『首爾』）piak出抗議，全國一時亂操操。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">尾--à竟然發現，尹錫悅是tī——無人民ê支持</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\"><i><b>〔1〕</b></i></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">、無軍隊ê支持</span><i style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">〔2〕</i><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">、無黨ê支持</span><i style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">〔3〕</i><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">，koh無學界ê支持</span><i style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">〔4〕</i><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">——hiah-nī仔歹pháng、oh la̍k權ê局勢之下宣佈戒嚴。本底hōo人心驚膽hiannh ê戒嚴，尾手suah變做全世界ê笑詼，tī 23:47（台灣時間）國會議員就nǹg入國會大樓，落尾開會以「贊成0、反對190」ê票數成功解嚴，尹錫悅ê政治生涯也到tsia為止。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是講，尹錫悅哪ē踮無代無誌、無人thang做bak-khuh ê狀況內自作自專宣佈戒嚴，舞做tsiah-nī仔hàm ê「政治自殺」--leh？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">原來，tī tse進前，伊ê政治前途早就puàn-suī--ah。自伊2022 tsiūnn任到tann，已經超過兩冬。Tī tsit兩冬之間，伊替財閥減稅，夯kuân散富差距；伊指揮警察搜查報導家己見笑代ê記者ê徛家，侵害新聞自由；伊甚至koh犯韓國人上m̄願原諒ê罪——伊kap進前ê朴槿惠總統siāng款，hōo身邊ê人tshap手政治，影響黨內ê提名。就是tsia-ê àu搭齣頭，hōo尹錫悅ê支持率跋落萬底深坑，hōo全國學者聯合要求落台，hōo伊為著保全家己ê利益、保障家己mài hōo國會調查，tsua̋nn pua̍h大kiáu宣佈戒嚴。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">講hiah濟，是beh kā兩項代誌舞hōo明：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">第一項，南韓tsit改戒嚴，是尹錫悅tshûn-pān保存私利，違憲hùn權所用ê àu步。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">第二項，khîng實ē hōo自由民主受著即時、嚴重、bē-tàng恢復ê危害--ê，就是像尹錫悅tsit款àu搭la̍k權、侵害自由ê àu手路。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo人kat目頭--ê是，踮受過獨裁hām世界頭名久長ê戒嚴苦毒ê台灣，竟然有人見著無半世紀前ê惡夢tī眼前險仔重搬了後，iáu是攑雙手贊成，替獨裁者拍pho̍k仔，koh表示lán自由台灣也該當戒嚴，惡夢m̄-nā beh看，koh想beh新做一場。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">而且，講tsit款有空無榫ê hàm古ê人，m̄是宣佈台灣戒嚴三擺，迫害、殺害無數台灣性命ê萬惡罪魁中國國民黨，suah顛倒是kap筆者仝款愛家己故鄉，愛tsit phiàn土地ê台派。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我beh踮tsia請逐个真心希望政府宣佈戒嚴ê同胞做一件tsiânn重要ê代：請你tshiau揣看māi，lán現此時ê自由，有偌濟是50冬前ê台灣人m̄ bat享受--ê。請你tshiau揣看māi，中華民國政府踮戒嚴ê 38冬內，做過啥mih thái-ko-nuā-lô、bē堪得看ê惡行。請你tshiau揣看māi，蔣介石ê軍隊，是按怎kā lán ê智識份子一phâng一phâng掠--起-來，lóng總tsām頭刣了了。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若準講你kā tsia-ê悲劇bat透透，suah iáu是支持蹧躂lán hē性命tsiah得--著ê自由，án-ne我bē giàn叫你台灣人。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細漢時tiānn-tiānn聽著序大人kā我提醒，叫我「歹路m̄-thang行」。我知影藍白有偌狼毒，對lán ê國家傷害有偌深。Iáu-m̄-koh「人」to無應該行歹路--ah，kám講「國」tio̍h-ài行戒嚴tsit款害人民、無天良ê歹路？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">1.2024/11/29支持率19%。</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">2.基層兵仔、士官長踮ta̋nn戒嚴ê時動作普遍慢死趖，國會周圍ê駐軍甚至無實心銃子。</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">3.執政黨黨主席家己mā公開反對戒嚴。</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">4.全國大學教授lóng總2,500人以上同齊發表「時局宣言」，要求總統落台。</p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhh76PM1dOnrhWHs00aEgrCynFtDOUlBsTNjriimXwUezvWvf2-c61CDpXp5STBPJ1t-qrW-cy7n8m-gEFknSrynXc7-J6_1OxmKgNZOcEo8iHuij4j1c8JVvVWsUr3B8eYlWdMo0G8dOntjtMXW2bx3MczrqhzswGbeCBaT-zE0anvkEm0NmaAMgH47StI/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_28.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhh76PM1dOnrhWHs00aEgrCynFtDOUlBsTNjriimXwUezvWvf2-c61CDpXp5STBPJ1t-qrW-cy7n8m-gEFknSrynXc7-J6_1OxmKgNZOcEo8iHuij4j1c8JVvVWsUr3B8eYlWdMo0G8dOntjtMXW2bx3MczrqhzswGbeCBaT-zE0anvkEm0NmaAMgH47StI/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_28.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi41ZqS3o0eMV_8ztrbfs9QUmxNcB0PHfdK-fZR6xvD_1GvXrMAciTSOo8Ka-PzEWEjgGX-JU4_UCo29rSwDG6boKBAN6dxe8G8K7eqkHlJyL3urVvf8g7RHJW-Z09vJKUkPri55tCp16no8X_xjBOOGwF2_D_7rOEYMYx2aULxoryysIOPbVHFR-vCR3Cr/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_29.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi41ZqS3o0eMV_8ztrbfs9QUmxNcB0PHfdK-fZR6xvD_1GvXrMAciTSOo8Ka-PzEWEjgGX-JU4_UCo29rSwDG6boKBAN6dxe8G8K7eqkHlJyL3urVvf8g7RHJW-Z09vJKUkPri55tCp16no8X_xjBOOGwF2_D_7rOEYMYx2aULxoryysIOPbVHFR-vCR3Cr/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_29.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEho_NJb6Iy6OuvA8Jx7YHRcAyJBoZ6cpxm_7cQvnh2-sQTbq1xBRM5Z1nh77keV8mSsCzoILZi4S0H1b3MH0DGX5mojieJVFOJ7eB7SmA_BgGqfYjnbZsITwtx6ZTPlXVItuyuEulcn5HDEGNMTFPUfWVpFPp1aMQyDO1lqHU4wLvItL4K4xI4P8b-Kw4i2/s1424/370%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEho_NJb6Iy6OuvA8Jx7YHRcAyJBoZ6cpxm_7cQvnh2-sQTbq1xBRM5Z1nh77keV8mSsCzoILZi4S0H1b3MH0DGX5mojieJVFOJ7eB7SmA_BgGqfYjnbZsITwtx6ZTPlXVItuyuEulcn5HDEGNMTFPUfWVpFPp1aMQyDO1lqHU4wLvItL4K4xI4P8b-Kw4i2/w450-h640/370%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br style=\"text-align: left;\" /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b style=\"font-size: large;\">#咱來講看māi 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\n<br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 370期，2025年1月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。 </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
